pan class=\"s1\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 24px;\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p3\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span class=\"s2\">ミーグリで<ruby>何<rt>なん</rt></ruby><ruby>人<rt>にん</rt></ruby>かと<ruby>写真<rt>しゃしん</rt></ruby><ruby>撮<rt>と</rt></ruby>ったので！</span></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 24px;\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 24px;\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p4\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 9px 0px 8px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><img alt=\"image6.jpeg\" src=\"/images/blogs/yamaguchi.haruyo/2022-11-07/46144_0.jpg\"><br></p><p class=\"p3\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span class=\"s2\">よーこ！！（<ruby>正<rt>ただし</rt></ruby><ruby>源<rt>みなもと</rt></ruby><ruby>司<rt>つかさ</rt></ruby><ruby>陽子<rt>ようこ</rt></ruby>ちゃん）</span></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 24px;\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p4\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 9px 0px 8px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><img alt=\"image5.jpeg\" src=\"/images/blogs/yamaguchi.haruyo/2022-11-07/46144_1.jpg\"><br></p><p class=\"p3\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span class=\"s2\">りおちゃん！（<ruby>清水<rt>しみず</rt></ruby><ruby>理央<rt>りお</rt></ruby>ちゃん）</span></p><p class=\"p3\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span class=\"s2\">ちょっとぶれててごめんなさいー！</span></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 24px;\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p4\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 9px 0px 8px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><img alt=\"image4.jpeg\" src=\"/images/blogs/yamaguchi.haruyo/2022-11-07/46144_2.jpg\"><br></p><p class=\"p3\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span class=\"s2\">りなちゃん</span><span class=\"s1\">(</span><span class=\"s2\"><ruby>渡辺<rt>わたなべ</rt></ruby><ruby>莉奈<rt>りな</rt></ruby>ちやん</span><span class=\"s1\">)</span><span class=\"s2\">とはるかちゃん</span><span class=\"s1\">(</span><span class=\"s2\"><ruby>山下<rt>やました</rt></ruby><ruby>葉<rt>よう</rt></ruby><ruby>留<rt>とめ</rt></ruby><ruby>花<rt>はな</rt></ruby>ちゃん</span><span class=\"s1\">)</span><span class=\"s2\">！</span></p><p class=\"p3\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span class=\"s2\"><ruby>制服<rt>せいふく</rt></ruby>のまりぃちゃんも</span><span class=\"s3\">😎</span></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 24px;\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p4\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 9px 0px 8px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><img alt=\"image3.jpeg\" src=\"/images/blogs/yamaguchi.haruyo/2022-11-07/46144_3.jpg\"><br></p><p class=\"p3\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span class=\"s2\">すみこ！</span><span class=\"s1\">(</span><span class=\"s2\"><ruby>宮地<rt>みやじ</rt></ruby>すみれちゃん</span><span class=\"s1\">)</span></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 24px;\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 24px;\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 24px;\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 24px;\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p3\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span class=\"s2\">みんな<ruby>本当<rt>ほんとう</rt></ruby>に<ruby>礼儀<rt>れいぎ</rt></ruby><ruby>正<rt>ただ</rt></ruby>しくて<ruby>可愛<rt>かわい</rt></ruby>くてもっとお<ruby>話<rt>はな</rt></ruby>してみたいです</span><span class=\"s3\">😊</span></p><p class=\"p3\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span class=\"s2\">あとひなあいのキャッチコピーが<ruby>可愛<rt>かわい</rt></ruby>かったです</span></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 24px;\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 24px;\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p3\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span class=\"s2\"><ruby>四<rt>よん</rt></ruby><ruby>期生<rt>きせい</rt></ruby>のみんな<ruby>改<rt>あらた</rt></ruby>めてこれからよろしくね</span><span class=\"s3\">🙇‍♀️</span></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 24px;\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 24px;\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: norma